Above assert statement should be inserted right above each instance of "Contains() or "LastIndexOf()". These functions behave differently as compared to IndexOf. The IndexOf function will return the first index of item, while the LastIndexOf function will return the last index of the Item. If no item is found, both functions will return -1. This assertion would fail if one of the methods are actually returning the index of the item which is not expected by the test.

